{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12234040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12234040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223404001:1":{"text":"지금 당장 물건을 내놓으라고 했잖아. 지금! 당장!","source_cn":"我要你们现在就给我发货！立刻！马上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97EED08F7E257C93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223404002:1":{"text":"진정하세요. 저희가 물건이 있는데도 안 드리는 게 아니잖습니까.","source_cn":"冷静点老哥，你这样好像我们有货故意不给你们发一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88AA7B73B02AD70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223404003:1":{"text":"너희가 물건이 있고 말고는 상관없어. 당장 내놓으라고!","source_cn":"我不管你们有没有货，我现在就要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA780B5CFAE4E631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223404004:1":{"text":"이렇게 하죠. 믿을만한 형제들을 보내서 당장 물건을 준비하라고 재촉하겠습니다.","source_cn":"你看要不这样吧，我让靠谱的兄弟过去催催，马上给你安排上发货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4071AFB80C62364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223404005:1":{"text":"이봐, 날 또 속이려는 거지? 뭐 몇 명을 보내려고 하는 건데?","source_cn":"小子，你又搪塞我是吧！？你叫几个弟兄去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C5FF0CD510829A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223404006:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 지금 당장 보내겠습니다. 제가 장담하죠!","source_cn":"别急，我们安排好马上给您发，我敢保证！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FF220724F56A96A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223404007:0":{"text":"지금 당장 물건을 내놓지 않으면 가게를 전부 부숴버리겠어!","source_cn":"我要是再看不到那批货到，就砸了你的鱼铺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1802D7451632119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223404008:0":{"text":"물건은 도망가지 않으니 걱정 마세요. 일단 돌아가서 기다리시죠.","source_cn":"放心，货跑不了，您回去等货吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B66B89E19A58D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223404009:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 또 부끄러운 모습을 보였군요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB39755112F105310","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 또 부끄러운 모습을 보였군요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 또 부끄러운 모습을 보였군요.","variant_male_record_index":"140142","variant_female_record_index":"140143","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223404010:1":{"text":"형제들에게 감사 인사를 하라고 보냈는데, 이건 참...","source_cn":"原本兄弟们想酬谢下你，但现在……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x27A4923CC0556C76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_key